# Times are America/Denver (TZ is set in the container), so DST is handled automatically.
# Job 1: pull the OptionStrat data and list the tickers for equity-watch's beta job.
45 7  * * 1-5  /app/fetch.sh
25 13 * * 1-5  /app/fetch.sh
# Job 2: build and publish the report from that data. equity-watch runs its beta job at
# 08:05 and 14:05 (about a minute at its throttled rate), so these follow it by a few minutes.
# If either time moves, move the other, and keep the gap under report.sh's 90-minute limit.
10 8  * * 1-5  /app/publish.sh
10 14 * * 1-5  /app/publish.sh
